# The project builds from the website folder, so nothing outside it is
# needed. The courses folder at the top of the repository is the same
# material the site serves out of website/public/courses, and the launch
# film folder is a render that is not part of the site.
#
# Without this the upload carries forty megabytes of films and duplicated
# decks that the build never reads, and the upload is slow enough to time
# out.
